          "maintenance": false,
          "text": "“ Applicable Margin ” means the corresponding percentages per annum as set forth below based on the Consolidated Net Leverage Ratio: | Revolving Credit Loans | Pricing Level | Consolidated Net Leverage Ratio | Commitment Fee | Term SOFR + | Base Rate + | I | Less than 1.00 to 1.00 | 0.20 | % | 1.25 | % | 0.25 | % | II | Greater than or equal to 1.00 to 1.00 but less than 1.50 to 1.00 | 0.25 | % | 1.50 | % | 0.50 | %"
