          "text": "tments not contemplated by the above provisions; provided that, subject to Section 1.10 , immediately before and immediately after giving pro forma effect to any such Investments and any Indebtedness incurred in connection therewith, no Event of Default shall have occurred and be continuing and the Consolidated Net Leverage Ratio on a Pro Forma Basis shall not exceed 2.50 to 1.00."
        }
